{"type":"message","id":"7dfaf82f","parentId":"8dc3cdb2","timestamp":"2026-04-21T00:00:04.358Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"[cron:0f2e06c5-425c-40b2-845b-135e47277fe1 github-repo-daily-briefing] 매일 09:00 KST 기준으로 GitHub 인기 레포 브리핑을 생성해 Sam에게 한국어로 전달하세요. 반드시 GitHub API(gh api 또는 공식 REST)로 실제 데이터를 조회하세요. 출력 형식: (1) 최근 인기 Top 5(최근 7일 생성 + stars 기준), (2) 누적 스타 상위 Top 5(archived 제외, 가능하면 최근 활동 있는 레포 우선), (3) 각 레포 핵심 설명 1~2문장(무엇/왜 중요한지), (4) OpenClaw 또는 Claude Code에 바로 적용 가능한 아이디어 3~5개(자동화/보안/개발생산성 관점), (5) 오늘 바로 실행할 액션 3개. 중복 레포는 한 번만 노출하고 전체 2500자 이내로 간결하게 작성하세요.\nCurrent time: Tuesday, April 21st, 2026 - 9:00 AM (Asia/Seoul) / 2026-04-21 00:00 UTC\n\nReturn your response as plain text; it will be delivered automatically. If the task explicitly calls for messaging a specific external recipient, note who/where it should go instead of sending it yourself."}],"timestamp":1776729604351}}
{"type":"message","id":"f361b077","parentId":"7dfaf82f","timestamp":"2026-04-21T00:00:27.149Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"이 작업은 GitHub 레포지토리 일일 브리핑을 생성하는 것입니다. 요구사항을 분석해보면:\n\n1. GitHub API로 실제 데이터 조회 (gh api 또는 REST API)\n2. 두 가지 카테고리:\n   - 최근 인기 Top 5 (최근 7일 생성 + stars 기준)\n   - 누적 스타 상위 Top 5 (archived 제외, 최근 활동 있는 레포 우선)\n3. 각 레포 핵심 설명 1~2문장\n4. OpenClaw/Claude Code 적용 가능 아이디어 3~5개\n5. 오늘 바로 실행할 액션 3개\n6. 중복 제거, 전체 2500자 이내, 한국어로\n\n먼저 GitHub API를 사용해 데이터를 조회해야 합니다. `gh` CLI가 있는지 확인하고 사용하겠습니다.\n\n실제 GitHub API를 호출해야 합니다:\n1. 최근 인기 레포: `gh search repos --order stars --sort stars created:>2026-04-14` (7일 전)\n2. 누적 스타 상위: `gh search repos --order stars --sort stars archived:false`\n\n쿼리를 실행해서 실제 데이터를 가져온 후 분석하겠습니다.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"GitHub API에서 실제 데이터를 조회하겠습니다."},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_7a230e113e8942868484874a","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"gh search repos --order stars --sort stars created:>2026-04-14 --limit 5 --json name,description,stargazerCount,url,language,createdAt,updatedAt,repositoryTopics --jq '.'"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"zai","model":"glm-4.7","usage":{"input":12654,"output":685,"cacheRead":1649,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":14988,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1776729604365,"responseId":"20260421080005d7d92e296183444f"}}
{"type":"message","id":"87cdc312","parentId":"f361b077","timestamp":"2026-04-21T00:00:27.283Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_7a230e113e8942868484874a","toolName":"exec","content":[{"type":"text","text":"invalid argument \"stars\" for \"--order\" flag: valid values are {asc|desc}\n\nUsage:  gh search repos [<query>] [flags]\n\nFlags:\n      --archived                    Filter based on the repository archived state {true|false}\n      --created date                Filter based on created at date\n      --followers number            Filter based on number of followers\n      --forks number                Filter on number of forks\n      --good-first-issues number    Filter on number of issues with the 'good first issue' label\n      --help-wanted-issues number   Filter on number of issues with the 'help wanted' label\n      --include-forks string        Include forks in fetched repositories: {false|true|only}\n  -q, --jq expression               Filter JSON output using a jq expression\n      --json fields                 Output JSON with the specified fields\n      --language string             Filter based on the coding language\n      --license strings             Filter based on license type\n  -L, --limit int                   Maximum number of repositories to fetch (default 30)\n      --match strings               Restrict search to specific field of repository: {name|description|readme}\n      --number-topics number        Filter on number of topics\n      --order string                Order of repositories returned, ignored unless '--sort' flag is specified: {asc|desc} (default \"desc\")\n      --owner strings               Filter on owner\n      --size string                 Filter on a size range, in kilobytes\n      --sort string                 Sort fetched repositories: {forks|help-wanted-issues|stars|updated} (default \"best-match\")\n      --stars number                Filter on number of stars\n  -t, --template string             Format JSON output using a Go template; see \"gh help formatting\"\n      --topic strings               Filter on topic\n      --updated date                Filter on last updated at date\n      --visibility strings          Filter based on visibility: {public|private|internal}\n  -w, --web                         Open the search query in the web browser\n\n(Command exited with code 1)"}],"details":{"status":"completed","exitCode":1,"durationMs":110,"aggregated":"invalid argument \"stars\" for \"--order\" flag: valid values are {asc|desc}\n\nUsage:  gh search repos [<query>] [flags]\n\nFlags:\n      --archived                    Filter based on the repository archived state {true|false}\n      --created date                Filter based on created at date\n      --followers number            Filter based on number of followers\n      --forks number                Filter on number of forks\n      --good-first-issues number    Filter on number of issues with the 'good first issue' label\n      --help-wanted-issues number   Filter on number of issues with the 'help wanted' label\n      --include-forks string        Include forks in fetched repositories: {false|true|only}\n  -q, --jq expression               Filter JSON output using a jq expression\n      --json fields                 Output JSON with the specified fields\n      --language string             Filter based on the coding language\n      --license strings             Filter based on license type\n  -L, --limit int                   Maximum number of repositories to fetch (default 30)\n      --match strings               Restrict search to specific field of repository: {name|description|readme}\n      --number-topics number        Filter on number of topics\n      --order string                Order of repositories returned, ignored unless '--sort' flag is specified: {asc|desc} (default \"desc\")\n      --owner strings               Filter on owner\n      --size string                 Filter on a size range, in kilobytes\n      --sort string                 Sort fetched repositories: {forks|help-wanted-issues|stars|updated} (default \"best-match\")\n      --stars number                Filter on number of stars\n  -t, --template string             Format JSON output using a Go template; see \"gh help formatting\"\n      --topic strings               Filter on topic\n      --updated date                Filter on last updated at date\n      --visibility strings          Filter based on visibility: {public|private|internal}\n  -w, --web                         Open the search query in the web browser\n\n(Command exited with code 1)","cwd":"/home/lfant/.openclaw/workspace"},"isError":false,"timestamp":1776729627279}}
